## Writing a Tweak

A tweak is a plain .js file that runs inside JavaScriptCore. 64-bit pointers are hex strings. Wrap code in an IIFE:

```javascript
(() => {
  log("Hello from my tweak!");
  var app = r_msg2(r_class("UIApplication"), "sharedApplication");
  var win = r_msg2(app, "keyWindow");
})();
```

