## RemoteCall API

| Function | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `log(msg)` | Print to log |
| `r_class(name)` | ObjC class pointer |
| `r_sel(name)` | String → SEL |
| `r_nsstr(str)` | Allocate NSString (release when done) |
| `r_msg2(t,s,a1..a4)` | Send ObjC message |
| `r_msg2_main(t,s,a1..a4)` | Send on main thread |
| `r_responds(t,s)` | respondsToSelector check |

## QuickLoader Prefs

```javascript
r_pref_num("key")  // float
r_pref_bool("key") // bool
r_pref_str("key")  // string
```

